{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>秘魯地球物理研究所顯示，秘魯當地時間周五（20日）晚上7時09分（本港時間周六早上8時09分）發生6.7級地震。震央位於安第斯地區Junin，首都利馬等地區震感強烈。（秘魯地球物理研究所/新華社/路透社）</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T01:43:59.011303+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":102,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T01:04:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T02:15:11.339341+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T01:37:22.025930+00:00","content_hash":"28e23c5d3ecaae2cd362a843364dc063601a3fe19fde5335b92669ccaf45ae21","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}